3. Scanning targeted computer for open ports, services, versions and OS
Tool – NMAP
Steps:
Note: Make Firewall settings off -> Window defender firewall
Metasploitable IP = inet address <IP>
Nmap commands for targeted computers
- nmap -sT <target_ip> – TCP Connect () scan -sT
- nmap -sS <target_ip> – SYN Stealth Scan
- nmap -sP <target_ip> – Ping Scan
- nmap -sU <target_ip> – UDP Scan
- nmap -sV <target_ip> – Version Detection
- nmap -sO <target_ip> – OS finger Printing
- nmap -sT -P 1-1000 <target_ip> – Checking 1000 TCP Ports
- sudo nmap -sS -sV -p 1-1000 <target_ip>
Practical:
